    {
      "text": "Jacob said, Sell me this day thy birthright, Gen. 25:31. let us sell him to the Ishmeelites, Gen. 37:27. Joseph … sold unto the Egyptians, Gen. 41:56 (45:4). land shall not be sold for ever, Lev. 25:23. my servants … shall not be sold as bondmen, Lev. 25:42. Hebrew man, or an Hebrew woman, be sold unto thee, and serve thee six years, Deut. 15:12. thou shalt not sell her at all for money, Deut. 21:14. sell the oil, and pay thy debt, 2 Kgs. 4:7. even Joseph, who was sold for a servant, Ps. 105:17. Buy the truth, and sell it not, Prov. 23:23. for your iniquities have ye sold yourselves, Isa. 50:1. Ye have sold yourselves for nought, Isa. 52:3. they shall not sell of it, Ezek. 48:14. I will sell your sons and your daughters, Joel 3:8. because they sold the righteous for silver, Amos 2:6.",
